<h3 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-4.HNSW(HierarchicalNavigabl=
eSmallWorld)">4. HNSW (Hierarchical Navigable Small World)</h3>
<h4 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-TechnicalArchitecture.3">Te=
chnical Architecture</h4>
<p>HNSW builds a multi-layer graph structure:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Layer Construction</strong>: Vectors assigned to layers with exp=
onential probability</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Graph Building</strong>: Connect each node to <code>M</code> nea=
rest neighbors per layer</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Hierarchical Search</strong>: Start from top layer, navigate dow=
n to layer 0</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Greedy Navigation</strong>: Follow edges toward query vector</p>=
</li>
</ol>
<h4 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-KeyParameters.3">Key Parame=
ters</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b5=
a5c5a9-d24e-48a3-9296-9358b5dfeb8c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Parameter</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Impact</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Recommended Range</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>M</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Max connections per layer</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Graph connectivity</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>32-96</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>efConstruction</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Build-time search width</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Index quality vs build time</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>400-1200</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>ef</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search-time candidate pool</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Recall vs speed</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>100-2000</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-MathematicalFoundation.3">M=
athematical Foundation</h4>
<p><strong>Layer Assignment:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Layer probability: <code>P(layer =3D l) =3D (1/ln(2))^l</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Maximum layer: <code>=E2=8C=8A-ln(uniform(0,1)) =C3=97 mL=E2=8C=8B</code=
> where <code>mL =3D 1/ln(2)</code></p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Search Algorithm:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Layer l_max to 1</strong>: Find closest node using greedy search=
</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Layer 0</strong>: Expand search with <code>ef</code> candidates<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Result Selection</strong>: Return top-k from candidate pool</p><=
/li>
</ol>
<h4 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-PerformanceCharacteristics.=
3">Performance Characteristics</h4>
<p><strong>Strengths:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Excellent Recall</strong>: 97-100% achievable with proper tuning=
</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Logarithmic Complexity</strong>: O(log N) search time</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>No Training Required</strong>: Incremental construction</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Robust Performance</strong>: Consistent across different data di=
stributions</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Weaknesses:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>High Memory Usage</strong>: Graph structure overhead</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Build Time</strong>: Expensive construction for large datasets</=
p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Parameter Sensitivity</strong>: Requires tuning for optimal perf=
ormance</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-BenchmarkResults.3">Benchma=
rk Results</h4>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
