<h3 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-5.AdvancedHNSWVariants(HNSW=
_SQ,HNSW_PQ,HNSW_PRQ)">5. Advanced HNSW Variants (HNSW_SQ, HNSW_PQ, HNSW_PR=
Q)</h3>
<h4 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-HNSW_SQ(ScalarQuantization)=
">HNSW_SQ (Scalar Quantization)</h4>
<p>Combines HNSW graph with scalar quantization compression:</p>
<p><strong>Technical Details:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>SQ8</strong>: 8-bit scalar quantization of vector components</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Refinement</strong>: Optional FP16/FP32 refinement stage</p></li=
>
<li>
<p><strong>Memory Reduction</strong>: ~4x compression vs full precision</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Benchmark Results:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
