- Recall@10: 99.1%
- Average Latency: 6.20ms
- Throughput: 161 QPS</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"AI-997:MilvusVectorDatabaseIndexTypes-HNSW_PQ(ProductQuantization=
)">HNSW_PQ (Product Quantization)</h4>
<p>Applies product quantization within HNSW structure:</p>
<p><strong>Performance Characteristics:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Higher compression than SQ but lower recall in my testing.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Suitable for memory-constrained environments</p></li>
<li>
<p>Requires careful parameter tuning</p></li>
